opitulemused_en:
- After passing the course student
- Upon successful completion of this course, students should:
*	be capable of systemic cooperation with supervisors; 
*	have improved their ability to plan their work and to stick to set time frames;
*	be capable of creating links between theoretical approaches, methods of analysis and empirical data relevant to the topic of their MA thesis or MA project;
