hindamise_eeltingimused:
Each student must:
* Participate actively in discussions during lectures and seminars. If a student misses more than half of the lectures, then they will not pass the course;
*Prepare a research paper;
* Present the research paper (the research question, methodology and results).

Assessment criteria for the research paper:

* Creativeness, consistency, completeness and correctness of the answers to the research question;
* Depth of the analysis of problems and applicable norms and principles;
* Association of theory with state and court practice;
* Structure and formatting.

