- - develop transferable skills in a working environment (such as teamwork, time management, project management, etc);
- - provide feedback about the internship to the tutor and other students.
- - has reflected on their experience and knows their strengths and weaknesses in relation to a practical work environment

- Learning outcomes
- knows the teaching methods of school stage 2 and is able to apply them in his / her work, following basic national documents;
- is able to plan studies in school stage 2;
- can analyze his / her own learning activities.

