opitulemused_en:
- Upon successful completion of the course, students will:
- 1. Understand what data analytics is as a broad domain and how it is utilised to solve problems in the business context to deliver value;
- 2. Understand the basics of data analysis and visualisation;
- 3. Be familiar with different data analysis methods and tools;
- 4. Understand the basics of deriving insights from data and communicating them;
- 5. Be familiar with how data analytics is practised by specialists to address business questions;
- 6. Develop skills in storytelling and working in groups.

hindamise_eeltingimused:
To obtain a "pass" grade for the course, students must:
Complete all assignments successfully (quizzes, individual homework, group work);
AND participate in at least 60% (6 out of 10) of lectures;
AND participate in the seminar where their group presents the results of the group work;
AND participate in the seminar dedicated to retrospective for the group work.

