Kodulugemine - 15 punkti
Esitlus - 15 punkti

opitulemused_en:
- After completing the course, the student:
- - is familiar with the older and newer history of the South Estonian written language;
- - knows the available Võro and Seto language resources.

- Student  who have completed the course:
- 1. analyses nature of restorative justice in a community context;
- 2. applies appropriate conflict resolution methods in restorative justice practices;
- 3. plans a restorative justice practice process based on the needs of their community and is able to carry it out.

- A graduate of this course:
- * can collect and store data in such a way that they can be used for automatic processing;
- * knows how to connect different data tables, create Pivot tables and graphs in the Excel program;
- * have acquired the basic concepts related to the theory of relational databases;
- * can create a database using PostgreSQL, create tables and enter data;
- * can understand and read database schemes developed by others;
- * can create SQL queries (including using functions, connecting tables and creating subqueries, creating views);
- * has basic knowledge of spatial data analysis using PostgreSQL;
- * can use the help of artificial intelligence (ChatGPT) to create a database and create queries and validate solutions created by artificial intelligence.

- After passing the course student
- has planned for herself/himself the subject that best supports her/his professional development;
- has learned based on the planned plan and evaluated the achievement of learning outcomes;
- has planned further development steps based on self-analysis.

