opitulemused_en:
- After completion the student:
- Will know the most important theoretical views regarding career development;
- Will analyze themselves and their opportunities across different life roles and based on the analysis will know how to make appropriate career choices;
- Will analyze their motivation and time consumption and will know how to apply time management skills;
- Will know how to design and carry out activities for achieving one's career-related goals.
- Analyses self in the context of future skills.

