opitulemused_en:
- After successful passing the student will be able to:
- - understand the character of interoperability of geographic information;
- - understand the basics of ArcGIS and coordinate systems;
- - create and manage a geodatabase, edit a spatial data;
- - query a GIS database;
- - present data clearly using maps, charts, and reports;
- - create programs in Model Builder;
- - continue with self-instruction according to one's own needs.

