- Student:
- 1. acknowledges the risks and success factors of the planning and management of the long-term and/or international project;
- 2. knows the project-specific possibilities for self- and co-funding and possesses the skills to plan  ja implement them;
- 3. detects different roles in team work;
- 4. has basic knowledge about  personnel management in the context of project work.

